cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "HPE: Human Pose Estimation"
abstract: >-
  A freely available desktop application for human pose estimation
  (23 keypoints including hand tips and foot points) from video and images,
  with faithful ByteTrack tracking, ID repair, keypoint correction and
  Butterworth smoothing with automatic cut-off selection (Winter's residual
  analysis). Runs with ONNX Runtime; no Python required.
type: software
authors:
